e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Pregnancy (known)\n-  Critically ill patients\n-  Patients with known renal or genitourinary structural abnormalities or prior pelvic/genitourinary surgery\n-  Chronic renal disease\n-  Patients presenting outside the defined treatment windows\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Pregnancy (known)",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "Pregnancy"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Critically ill patients",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "ill"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Patients with known renal"\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "or genitourinary structural abnormalities",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "structural abnormalities"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "or prior pelvic/"\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "raw_text": "genitourinary surgery"\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n       