e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Female, older than 35 years. Already have mammography, or other standard exams (ultrasound, MRI, etc). Could participate this trial within 2 weeks after mammography. Have the ability of consent inform.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Female, older than 35 years. Already have mammography,"\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "or other standard exams (ultrasound,"\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "MRI, etc). Could participate this trial within 2 weeks after mammography. Have the ability of consent inform."\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "Have the ability of consent inform."\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
