e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  patients (adults and children)\n-  patients recipients in France from 2008 to 2015 of a first kidney transplant / heart / lung / liver donor living or deceased, non-immunized anti-HLA before the transplant\n-  patients having preserved their graft > 2 years\n-  having agreed to the use for research purposes in transplantation of the remains of the DNA and serum samples taken as part of the care of which the remains are available\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- patients (adults and children)"\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- patients recipients in France from 2008 to 2015 of a first kidney transplant / heart /"\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "lung /"\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "liver donor living"\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "or deceased,"\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "NOT": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "raw_text": "non-immunized anti-HLA before the transplant",\n                                  "Condition": [\n                                    "immunized"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Observation": [\n                                    "anti-HLA"\n                                  ]\n                                }\n                              }\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- patients having preserved their graft > 2 years",\n          "Observation": [\n            "graft"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- having agreed to the use for research purposes in transplantation of the remains of the DNA and serum samples taken as part of the care of which the remains are available",\n      "Observation": [\n        "DNA",\n        "serum samples"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
