e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Male and Female, between 18 and 80 years, ASA 1-3, Scheduled for open thoracotomy\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "OR": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "- Male"\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "and Female, between 18 and 80 years, ASA 1-3, Scheduled for",\n          "Observation": [\n            "ASA"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "open thoracotomy"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
