e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Ocular ischemia syndrome group: Patients diagnosed with ocular ischemia syndrome;\n-  Age-related macular degeneration group (Control group): Patients diagnosed with age-related macular degeneration;\n-  Age: 50-80 years;\n-  Sex: all;\n-  Patients signed written informed consent.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Ocular ischemia syndrome group: Patients diagnosed with ocular ischemia syndrome;",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "Ocular ischemia syndrome"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Age-related macular degeneration group (Control group): Patients diagnosed with age-related macular degeneration;",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "macular degeneration"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- Age: 50-80 years;"\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Sex: all;"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Patients signed written informed consent."\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
