e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Age between 20 years old and 65 years old\n-  Diagnosis of major depressive disorder, bipolar disorder, and schizophrenia, compatible with SCID for DSM-5, with clinical necessity of ECT under a psychiatrist\'s evaluation and decision\n-  Patients with adequate visual acuity and auditory acuity without or with correction\n-  Patients or patients\' legal representative signing up the informed consent\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Age between 20 years old and 65 years old"\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Diagnosis of major depressive disorder,",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "depressive disorder"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "bipolar disorder,",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "bipolar disorder"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "and schizophrenia, compatible with SCID for DSM-5,",\n                          "Condition": [\n                            "schizophrenia"\n                          ]\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "raw_text": "with clinical necessity of ECT under a psychiatrist\'s evaluation and decision"\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Patients with adequate visual acuity",\n              "Observation": [\n                "visual acuity"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "and auditory acuity",\n                  "Observation": [\n                    "auditory acuity"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "without or with correction"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Patients or patients\' legal representative signing up the informed consent"\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
