e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Patients who have had brain death or serious brain trauma.\n-  Healthy people who are interested in optical assessment of hemodynamic parameters\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Patients who have had brain death",\n          "Condition": [\n            "brain death"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "or serious brain trauma.",\n          "Observation": [\n            "trauma"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Healthy people who are interested in optical assessment of hemodynamic parameters",\n      "Condition": [\n        "Healthy"\n      ],\n      "Observation": [\n        "hemodynamic parameters"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
