e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Infants born out of the hospital and secondarily hospitalized in the hospital Femme-Mère-Enfant.\n-  Multiple pregnancies,\n-  children with congenital fetal anomalies\n-  pregnancies without first trimester ultrasound (to date the pregnancy)\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Infants born"\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "NOT": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "out of the hospital"\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "raw_text": "and secondarily hospitalized in the hospital Femme-M\\u00e8re-Enfant."\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- Multiple pregnancies,",\n              "Condition": [\n                "pregnancies"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- children with congenital fetal anomalies",\n          "Condition": [\n            "congenital fetal anomalies"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- pregnancies",\n          "Condition": [\n            "pregnancies"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "NOT": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "without first trimester ultrasound (to date the pregnancy)"\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
