e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Patient with paroxysmal/persistent/permanent atrial fibrillation\n-  CHA2DS2VASc score ≥2 for male and ≥3 for female\n-  Without contraindications to anticoagulation therapy\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Patient with paroxysmal/"\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "persistent/"\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "permanent atrial fibrillation",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "atrial fibrillation"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- CHA2DS2VASc score \\u22652 for male and \\u22653 for female",\n          "Observation": [\n            "CHA2DS2VASc"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "-"\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "NOT": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "Without contraindications to anticoagulation therapy"\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
