e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n• has a psychiatric condition or symptoms (i.e., diagnosis of paranoid schizophrenia or active paranoid delusional thoughts, as determined via a telephone or in-person screening assessment) that would interfere with study participation.\nExclusion Criteria for Optional EEG Measurement:\n-  a history of seizure condition within the last year\n-  a significant brain injury or skull defect\n-  a history of brain cancer.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "\\u2022 has a psychiatric condition",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "psychiatric condition"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "or symptoms (i.e., diagnosis of paranoid schizophrenia",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "psychiatric condition",\n                        "paranoid schizophrenia"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "or active paranoid delusional thoughts, as determined via a telephone or in-person screening assessment) that would interfere with study participation.",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "paranoid delusional thoughts"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "Exclusion Criteria for Optional EEG Measurement:"\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- a history of seizure condition within the last year",\n          "Condition": [\n            "seizure condition"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- a significant brain injury",\n          "Observation": [\n            "injury"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "or skull defect",\n          "Condition": [\n            "skull defect"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
