e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Study participants will be infants (and their parents) who have undergone cardiac surgery at Children\'s Mercy Kansas City in the first six weeks of life and are currently less than 18 months of age at the time of being approached for participation in this study.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "- Study participants will be infants (and their parents) who have undergone cardiac surgery at Children\'s Mercy Kansas City in the first six weeks of life"\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "and are currently less than 18 months of age at the time of being approached for participation in this study."\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
