e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Genetic problems such as galactose intolerance, Lapp lacatase deficiency, glucose-galactose malabsorption\n-  Clinically significant disease such as liver, kidney, digestive, pulmonary, endocrine system, cardiovascular disease etc.\n-  People who have gastrointestinal disease or history of surgery which would affect absorption of drug.\n-  History of clinically significant drug induced hyper-sensitive reaction or drug related muscular disease\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Genetic problems such as galactose intolerance,",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "galactose intolerance",\n                    "Genetic problems"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "Lapp lacatase deficiency,",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "Lapp lacatase deficiency"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "glucose-galactose malabsorption",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "glucose-galactose malabsorption"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Clinically significant disease such as liver,",\n                  